<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Peeking</h1>
<p>Skill
Class: Thief (guild level 8)
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre> peek &lt;character&gt;
</pre>
<p>Peeking is a useful thieving skill used to scan another person's inventory.
Usually a prelude to a theft.
</p><p>You see what they carry, not what they wear. Your peeking skill, dexterity
and brain are tried against their brain and dexterity (and their own
peeking skill, if they are a player); someone asleep can't stop you at all.
If you fail badly, they catch you peeking and you lose any
invisibility. It is no crime, though, and
doesn't start a fight. You can't peek while fighting. Practising it needs
brain 15.
</p><p>See also:
